   "text": "Comparative Growing Trials\nAll characteristics described below are from comparative\ngrowing trials conducted at the Potato Research Station,\nToolangi in Victoria in 1989/90 and 1990/91. Two\nhundred plants were grown in three replicates on\nkraznozem soil fertilised with Pivot 800 at 2t/ha.\nMeasurements are from 20 specimens selected at\nrandom. Plants were irrigated as required and prophylactic\nsprays were applied four times for fungal diseases of\nfoliage.",
